<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Finance on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/finance/</link><description>Recent content in Finance on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/finance/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Ling-3.0-Flash-Fin</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/ling-3-0-flash-fin/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/ling-3-0-flash-fin/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Ant Group&amp;rsquo;s InclusionAI team released Ling-3.0-Flash-Fin on August 28, 2026, continuing the training of the base Ling-3.0-Flash model on financial data developed with CICC and other institutions. It keeps the same 124 billion parameter, 5.1 billion active mixture-of-experts design and 256K context window, but adds source-grounded financial search, multi-document reasoning across regulatory filings and earnings reports, and spreadsheet-native valuation work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ant published BF16 weights on Hugging Face under an MIT license and opened a one-month free API trial, aiming the model at tasks like reading annual reports, building DCF models, and cross-referencing filings: the kind of grunt work that eats analyst hours at banks and research desks.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Palmyra-Fin</title><link>https://bestofai.io/models/palmyra-fin/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/models/palmyra-fin/</guid><description/></item><item><title>SwiftAlerts</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/swiftalerts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/swiftalerts/</guid><description/></item><item><title>AlphaSense</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/alphasense/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/alphasense/</guid><description/></item><item><title>BILL AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/bill-com-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/bill-com-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Botkeeper</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/botkeeper/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/botkeeper/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Causal</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/causal-app/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/causal-app/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Expensify</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/expensify-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/expensify-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Kensho</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/kensho/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/kensho/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Morningstar AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/m